{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"svelte","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Svelte","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for Svelte (.svelte).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"svelte","name":"Svelte","extensions":[".svelte"],"grammar":"grammars/svelte.json","blockComment":["<!--","-->"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Svelte","path":"snippets/svelte.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/svelte.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<!\\\\-\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\->\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{[#:/@]\\\\w+\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"(?:on|bind|class|use|transition|in|out|animate):[A-Za-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/?>\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[{}]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/svelte.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svelte\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<script>\",\n      \"\\t$1\",\n      \"</script>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<style>\",\n      \"</style>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A component\"\n  },\n  \"If block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#if ${1:condition}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{/if}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An if block\"\n  },\n  \"Each block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#each ${1:items} as ${2:item}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{/each}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An each block\"\n  },\n  \"Await block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"await\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{#await ${1:promise}}\",\n      \"\\t<p>Loading...</p>\",\n      \"{:then ${2:value}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{:catch error}\",\n      \"\\t<p>{error.message}</p>\",\n      \"{/await}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An await block\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Svelte\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Svelte.\n\n## Files\n\n`.svelte`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `svelte` | A component |\n| `if` | An if block |\n| `each` | An each block |\n| `await` | An await block |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}